        {
            "title": "龍湖10月合同銷售按年跌逾五成",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">龍湖集團(00960)公佈，2026年10月單月實現合同銷售金額24.3億元(人民幣‧下同)，按年跌51.4%，合同銷售面積28.9萬平方米，按年跌35.2%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"龍湖官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/05/00960-Web.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"龍湖官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/05/00960-Web.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">龍湖官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">10月單月實現歸屬公司股東權益的合同銷售金額16.9億元，按年跌52.26%，歸屬公司股東權益的合同銷售面積20.7萬平方米，按年跌36.5%。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">截至2026年10月31日止10個月，累計實現總合同銷售金額255.7億元，按年跌54.13%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">合同銷售面積279.5萬平方米，按年跌57.03%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">截至2026年10月31日止10個月，本集團實現運營及服務業務不含稅收入約227億元，按年升2.4%；其中，運營收入約121.7億元，按年升3.66%，服務收入約105.3億元，按年升1.06%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17136913-%e9%be%8d%e6%b9%9610%e6%9c%88%e5%90%88%e5%90%8c%e9%8a%b7%e5%94%ae%e6%8c%89%e5%b9%b4%e8%b7%8c%e9%80%be%e4%ba%94%e6%88%90",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/05/20250512_FI_source-web_00960.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-07 16:23:01",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "遠信儲能超購1,387倍  中間定價  一手中籤率5%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">遠信儲能技術(09621)公布，最終發售價9.78元，約為招股兵範圍8.54元至11.1元中間，超額認購1,387.75倍。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">一手中籤率5%，申請20萬股方穩獲分配一手。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"遠信儲能官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/10/09621-Web.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"遠信儲能官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/10/09621-Web.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">遠信儲能官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">集資總額5.63億元，所得款項淨額5.02億元</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">三大行顯示招股價為9.78元，輝立暗盤收報21.66元，較招股價9.78元高1.21倍，以每手500股計，不計手續費，一手帳面賺5940元。耀才暗盤報21.9元，高招股價1.24倍，一手帳面賺6060元。富途暗盤報21.52元高1.2倍，一手帳面賺5870元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">遠信儲能全球發售5754.05萬股，其中香港佔10%，預計集資額約6.38億元。基石投資者CDH Global認購400萬美元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">上市保薦人為招銀國際。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17136769-%e9%81%a0%e4%bf%a1%e5%84%b2%e8%83%bd%e8%b6%85%e8%b3%bc1387%e5%80%8d-%e4%b8%ad%e9%96%93%e5%ae%9a%e5%83%b9-%e4%b8%80%e6%89%8b%e4%b8%ad%e7%b1%a4%e7%8e%875",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/10/09621.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-07 15:57:57",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
