            "title": "ADR高水67點  理想汽車高3.6%  夜期高水165點",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">摩根大通港股ADR指數較周五恒指收市高67點或0.3%，報23,244點。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：理想汽車官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20230804_FI_source-web_02015_Li_fb.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：理想汽車官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20230804_FI_source-web_02015_Li_fb.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：理想汽車官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">阿里巴巴(09988)ADR較港收市價高2.3%，折合107.28元，貢獻恒指43點 ; 友邦(01299) ADR較香港收市價高0.9%，折合79.18港元，貢獻恒指11點。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滙控(00005) ADR較香港收市價低1.2%，折合134.02港元，影響恒指12點 ; 中華煤氣(00003)ADR較香港收市價低15.2%，折6.273港元，影響恒指18點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">理想汽車(02015) ADR較香港收市價高3.6%，折合49.12港元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">聯想(00992)ADR收市折合港幣19.23元，較港收市價高2.2% ; 騰訊(00700)ADR收市折合港幣420.76元，較港收市價高0.2% ; 百度(09888) ADR收市折合港幣80.24元，較港收市價高2.6%。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒指夜市期指收報24647點，升148點，較昨日恒指收市24481點，高水165點，成交21168張。國指夜市期指收報8331點，較昨日國指收市高水57點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">反映中國概念股表現的金龍指數上揚1.67%，報5843點。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17135785-adr%e9%ab%98%e6%b0%b467%e9%bb%9e-%e7%90%86%e6%83%b3%e6%b1%bd%e8%bb%8a%e9%ab%983-6-%e9%98%bf%e9%87%8c%e5%8f%8b%e9%82%a6%e6%92%90%e5%b8%82",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/HKSTOCK-3.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-07 13:02:53",
